# Spacetime Field Representation

This repository explores a simple field-theory view of physics:

spacetime point
(x,y,z,t) ∈ ℝ⁴
        ↓
field function
f : ℝ⁴ → ℝⁿ
        ↓
physical field values
        ↓
constraints
        ↓
behavior

Examples:
- Electromagnetism: ℝ⁴ → ℝ⁶
- Gravity (metric tensor): ℝ⁴ → ℝ¹⁰

This repo contains notes and minimal code stubs for physics-informed neural field representations.
